<%# locals: (remaining:)

    The four countdown tiles to NextSlateDrop, for /turf-monster-v2's notify
    section and the drop-notify modal. Must sit inside an x-data="dropCountdown(...)"
    (the factory is defined on /turf-monster-v2), which owns days / hours /
    minutes / seconds and ticks them every second.

    FOUR TILES ON ONE ROW, down to 375px: tighter padding and type below sm,
    tabular-nums so the digits do not jitter as they tick. The region is a timer
    with aria-live off, and the seconds tile is aria-hidden on top of that, so a
    screen reader is never fed a per-second update. The no-JS frame is
    minute-precise (`remaining` is NextSlateDrop.remaining); seconds start at 00
    until Alpine runs. %>
<div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-2 sm:gap-3 max-w-2xl mx-auto" data-test="v2-countdown" role="timer" aria-live="off">
  <div class="card px-1 py-3 sm:p-4 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono tabular-nums text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-heading" x-text="days"><%= remaining[:days] %></p>
    <p class="label-upper mt-1 text-[10px] sm:text-xs">Days</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card px-1 py-3 sm:p-4 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono tabular-nums text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-heading" x-text="hours"><%= format("%02d", remaining[:hours]) %></p>
    <p class="label-upper mt-1 text-[10px] sm:text-xs">Hours</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card px-1 py-3 sm:p-4 text-center">
    <p class="font-mono tabular-nums text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-heading" x-text="minutes"><%= format("%02d", remaining[:minutes]) %></p>
    <p class="label-upper mt-1 text-[10px] sm:text-xs">Minutes</p>
  </div>
  <div class="card px-1 py-3 sm:p-4 text-center" aria-hidden="true" data-test="v2-countdown-seconds">
    <p class="font-mono tabular-nums text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-heading" x-text="seconds">00</p>
    <p class="label-upper mt-1 text-[10px] sm:text-xs">Seconds</p>
  </div>
</div>
